# User-owned runtime data never belongs in the source repository.
**/input/
**/logs/
**/results/
**/databases/
**/runs/
**/imports/
**/plugins/
**/.claude/
vault.salt

# Legacy automation projects are intentionally not part of Soft Hub.
Checkpoint_testnet/
fairground/
gigaverse/
risex/
sekai_testnet_clean/
skew_wl/
umia-testnet-bot/

# Internal technical documentation is kept outside the public repository.
docs/ARCHITECTURE_RU.md
docs/SECURITY_RU.md
docs/SOFTWARE_SPEC_RU.md
docs/PLUGIN_GUIDE_RU.md

# Captures and legacy-bot inputs may contain bearer tokens, cookies, private
# keys, authenticated proxy credentials, or mailbox/session credentials.
**/*.har
**/input/private_key*.txt
**/input/prox*.txt
**/input/email*.txt
**/input/twitter*.txt
**/input/telegram*.txt
**/input/capsolver*.txt
**/input/*password*.txt
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
*.pem
*.key
